===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|pullulātus|lang=la}}, perfect passive participle of {{term|pullulō||sprout forth|lang=la}}, from {{term|pullulus||a young animal, a sprout|lang=la}}, diminutive of {{term|pullus|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|/ˈpʌl.jʊ.leɪt/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-pullulate.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|pullulat}}

# To [[rapid]]ly [[multiply]].
# To [[germinate]].
# To [[teem]] with; to be filled with.

